# The Wrath of Khan {2}{R} Saga, every chapter. I - "This Saga deals 4 damage to target creature an opponent controls. At the
# beginning of the next combat this turn, gain control of that creature until end of turn. Untap it. It gains haste until end
# of turn.": Drift of Phantasms (0/5), the only creature an opponent controls, is tapped by Procrastinate (X=0, so no stun
# counters) and then takes the 4 damage on turn 3 and survives; at the beginning of that combat Bot1 gains control of it, it
# is untapped and it has haste; it returns to Bot2 at the end of the turn. II - a Mountain is exiled to draw a card on turn
# 5, the hand two cards before and after. III - Bot2 sacrifices a nontoken
# permanent, its Mox Emerald, on turn 7, and the Saga is sacrificed after it.

